<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>As a stream of love, how His life flows in!</l><l>Motivating us to just love Him.</l><l>So we give ourselves; Lord, do grow in us</l><l>May we know You in Your preciousness.</l><l>O Lord, do make us one as we run toward You,</l><l>Pursuing corporately in everything we do</l><l>With the saints until full maturity</l><l>As Your loving counterpart eternally.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
